          "reviewedOn": "2026-07-22",
          "evidence": "Authored module notes: Captures %USERPROFILE%\\.m2\\settings.xml (mirrors, proxies, profiles, server auth references) and settings-security.xml (master password encryption key). The local repository (~/.m2/repository) is excluded as a build cache. settings-security.xml is flagged as a secret and must not be auto-restored. Medium sensitivity because settings.xml server blocks commonly reference or inline credentials. Confidence: high - default user settings paths are documented by the official Maven Settings Reference. Authored secret warning: settings-security.xml contains the Maven master password used to decrypt server credentials stored in settings.xml. MUST NOT be auto-restored. Re-create with `mvn --encrypt-master-password` after restore. Also review settings.xml for plaintext \u003cpassword\u003e entries inside \u003cserver\u003e blocks before sharing. Authored excluded secret or machine-bound paths: %USERPROFILE%\\.m2\\settings-security.xml"
